{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1315,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8902104129a7561cb6136801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ガチでいくから……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a415b05a7300f13978a302a6e01fd93b4c5609cb6e508131a92ddc73e68951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b8e2225de5560c0604cb19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，差不多就开始训练吧。\n心理准备早就做好啦，\n接下来练就完事了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "def55f2b2e164302a13e57687450d46e4837f879437cef59ae700af3ea3bbc4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c63f4ab6ffca0d5c234d32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊，你已经来了啊。\n难道你一直在这儿等我吗？\n哈啊…你可真闲啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee3675ae50f157e5de2eaa34456ee66358bda624f7fbc4a15ee77376608be65e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:850f35dfd97b4c738a67714f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK，到时间了呢。\n…怎么了，不准备训练吗？\n啊，还是说准备去参加比赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd613cc55bda33ee402b188a7617e73bd6832fa494dd454563c0f6231856038e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4256e84cb3bba2a49ba92d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…不用那么担心地看着我啦。\n你不是知道的吗？\n我最喜欢奔跑时候的我了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dec44b73a7ea50d029d1daa8f9412743f97071d717edc8611d943123b9c87aa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7356fef8c0f04f4ff90e2a97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是为了我自己才奔跑的。\n不过呢，你要是说想看看我奔跑时的\n模样的话，我也会跑给你看啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4d8b2f6a7bd15a8957448cc6449fa9883b840d6e352b4a451e5ac0c080fab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6448f402e93c77c39341f300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想看看我奔跑时的模样吧？\n那就站近些好好注视着我啦。\n我会展现出最为闪耀的跑姿的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96aa407d2a1024f0a784ab83ada12d20e61e1ee4433b490b97cfa3d594a4aa2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e7b3e94b313ee8d8159be76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也准备好了的话，\n就赶紧开始训练吧？\n我现在可是想跑得不得了了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2855eaf2154fe52560aefa088e82ee923119f3faa6c58964944c55a4d5fc022",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ad0f0b3b77748237d91eb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体如舞蹈一般随心所动…\n嗯，感觉不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d420ce1c857e087c8bbff30c4b1705111accca9e0243a5f331ecd0d5b6aad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a658103e809d74cb6ffe48b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『一二・一』！\n这样喊过之后就气势十足了。\n好，快开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80029e7017558fb38cd37b303315af3fa89b14814ee8ec640580e6ba2741ef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb116ffb6d65c03e41fec11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好。\n已经“天人合一”…了吧？感觉不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "084ebce8ecae425f0171364dd21f510531fa94939242fed1d83394baae25efbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c9b6a94b33088612be7fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要进步的话，必须要练习才行。\n今天也按平时那样努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "786d9de80660dddc65b5812ecddd16e8ba11cf09fa1911193b4119c89490f77a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b003734c2218ab61244a9bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和风服装的拍摄工作也做过不少了，\n穿着跑步也完全没问题啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14547185e0788b138b1686a83a22a481f44bf1fa46e60505c316be921e7565fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8138eb56a0dab0560a08d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦你注意下我的跑步姿势啦。\n要是穿这身衣服却举止不得体的话\n就太逊了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "257be66dc52c6efc6540340d1b6608817d99af54bdaf8cc9446c86f5218c3b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd330b15ffc8d057cc3380f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息的时候，我来跳支舞吧。\n…哈哈，开玩笑的啦。\n不过你真想看的话也不是不行哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab4daaa61de1efa78f13fbb896ab9508aaf01050e251f5004f62b82738301b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1352514e2708b80d9a2a00df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "见识到真正的“我”了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fd1633a960b5db3e88b5c54e523a94f9c9d0733e00681a69a86675492903e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2370640ad6224a58067cb2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微更接近那时候的“我”了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64903d56199e4a8ee67862af7fac647a5b3be99a117d313bb9fe291db588a99d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0feac9f1b48cf6fb52cb6a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便祭典已经落幕…\n也要陪在我身边哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb4a743112652cab176dc61e7056afb520e1b168c45c6f034ae300dc33743d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd98249e9bd13378ff462cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样绚丽多彩的回忆…永生难忘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f7b9542f8a1d63f8e632d7de3a9c1aec759036131d81da2fc8363d1d3cfc45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00602ae5e143711f411f0a1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，总觉得力量涌上来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71d38f6502a502fed43d6097c9644bc34e2e5e00e426f27ee704a58068b74f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463f822507efc4bb736f6164",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更加…更加更加\n更加强大才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b170285259f3194566ec9813aafa0d4a46de8350a9426c966826056febf95588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b81195f90d4d013147aed980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是黄金城市。你好啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ed472930b906887059cf305747bd79947166ee44db23230d2a59d3a6c4f8e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58dabf3ab60784c2e04a5e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要成为那个我想成为的“我”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0565d6d45093d46b8935a2e7137f1681072f360b42ffc4076917e300d7a207c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8ae0b4e7d14fb265c54c93f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？这就是我的经纪人哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fc0a202f996b00f22843d38589f25503e1d90e3a8ccc976852bc0e8fd7a8e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d49c467044f369e66b7730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经纪人的感情…了解之后就燃起来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46cd8b535ff9bcb810349a99b6ff2c38e026d77f48c86a7c480f6f3dddd8431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db82832af4b251f5e6cba84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于染上“我”的颜色了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5176e78cd2a1e1027cf8fdc1b5862b867ea2e062852efbcdb960c900ef9f9da6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb8d99c7f8056d4e97b92c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我刮目相看了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "155fbf0474c10da3578c448d19a60f76a7323f45701c4d81a2d539487fe4601d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4875bbc9881633798b3628e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要上的话，\n那就跳出最为漂亮的舞蹈吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d183355162ecc49dd2ec87bee6eb991779ed47d883967e7dbcd26476831716ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ad3ae127dd48fcc0992a90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金城市。\n让我起舞吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "051fb11963e9dd69033be1444533df8c3cbcdd52893dbe2afae5d93953c6f332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b30d3655c816a2d2f2501e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着班长我冲啊ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45f98a110986a3792d4db2d3020b3849c876f306d29f12ff1ab2589dde1a9e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45dd288dbd70f1d525bf8c5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在此立誓！在您的指导之下\r\n我将成为全赛马娘的模范……\r\n成为最强的班长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dd58d198ecfb99d426a54ba8d158786242721f129213db63f5de7b85009573d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de56b698f16c0484e1110058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってまいります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b647331903ccfd460dce0cefc0d2c4020e3a5a1ffca47177a5bbb2bfe3b41d06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7549e735e80a468835902a80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8b04b4edb572764b45e483a28cd1cf6e40442b258dd629e84cb2d8e5633947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdd83bc7fd650f1cff91c4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的指导是不会错的！\r\n因为……您是我的训练员嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04ca6e09375bc86cb696d66b0397b603456a42be5abb8a24d5a9f11acf4432cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c16d6f06d31822441825fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手机已经完全充满电了！\r\n无论我什么时候在哪迷路，\r\n都能跟训练员联系上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0e6a44f9ced9dd5c695d170b859639e2e4130a9048ba0940b7e72b49651f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305c18d7182c72a934b30e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今年的抱负是爆、进！\r\n去年的一月就决定好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa792d7df40e74b90728731d3696301395392a8a7fb89e8b22da15fe01e2db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d48da6567c5a2bb1eaf671",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做到一半的巧克力……爆炸了。\r\n一定是承受不住\r\n我炽热的感谢之情才会这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c4adc70a8446fd7a74f9c2d3231b4cad888d3c8befce492b96af84be08291f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96346f9073070403ff216991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我为已经是成人的训练员！\r\n准备了焦黑的苦味巧克力哦！\r\n哼哼──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "834fbe7f595c0b0dec9550de552bba5e18374d1d26376acdcc7936a66f2121e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2ce786afc80c095ff135d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……要快速、要快速、要快速！\r\n来，过来吧流星！\r\n我已经准备好我的愿望了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4006e0c777553e8edc43e3f643ab8c2a7e9deaebd799ae235fbf5dd818933891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18fef63e6169c1f88cc4e92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！\r\n奇怪？我听说念这段咒语\r\n就能免费拿到点心的来着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "463573b9e72281f6a3c13057811e34db8671e0b475c88ae58b0cfdb8fc4cba67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d873513962146e44186676e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要尽情享受圣诞节的气氛哦！\r\n所有活动都率先执行\r\n才是班长该有的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0019338a5fefe12eeac5f7f1cb1fa4cb39546241c8e5dce59d0cdbf7e8a53882",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a36b91c11ecb028818c5d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，您知道吗？\r\n圣诞老人的速度是非常快的喔。\r\n快到竟然连我都追不上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0467216314ca5b99f305f6ad06e77e1a29e85c81b922fab3c757de7bf9d78fbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acaec10c3d17698e9856b395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一百分哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b97e1f4cef1447e3003fc53f40aa800be7c454487e89355666f255e562e42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de33794f2665df0227fc7091",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要大扫除吗！？交给我吧！\r\n只要把地上的东西全都丢掉，\r\n几乎所有房间都会看起来很干净！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44bd2afc99b1fc0e740f535a1e8924e852e6a70368e86f585bc7b5fa53c34f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafd65ec065c905ecdc67444",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟生日嘛，生活上的杂事\r\n就交给我来做吧！\r\n今天我有信心不会打破任何东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8044869add1c7343c1eba2f577229bd043f31cbbaa4722f36fd494a9211215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec5bb74e5c57dc93d79ce72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝您生日快乐！\r\n训练员确实成长了不少，\r\n这……由我来给予肯定！拍拍手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0705ddbb84a4f9d2bd98dac394ce19a030dc1f068d5c360fe837a5dbb21410",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f74c71727094740f67d59ecc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就是我诞生的日子！\r\n我也不介意你把这天\r\n当作纪念日哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4485524d3d5af62d54248c63c0a1d5d5d077a31c26a83ab2a86979b2d93c9c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71b848d04f37e623206bc0a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿……刚才父亲和母亲\r\n都祝我生日快乐呢……\r\n老实说我现在非常开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05b51e099bb8c80a81a6a9469a0718b508d53d83cf7a1bbb00900689fe94ce75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86823c4d96dfdf2f01181e0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有什么新的公告哦！\r\n说不定跟我的班级有关！\r\n来确认看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "865334bb2c4de1a950561325348b926de61eae3b7682e7cf24cf0617be868b99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d554109d688dda3a8788e19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到了礼物哦！\r\n会不会是要奖励我们\r\n活跃表现的礼物啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b42bfb017c16c8d7d74152d6d09e15313520dd8ba57933b9eb04936f5ad4f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b41d22857214157646312bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的目标好像达成了哦！\r\n我也为您感到很骄傲呢！\r\n嗯哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df9dd59c11142fcb2ccf9d2c1d185afc8f3e814fc5e1e2f2c7d59d5dea919f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b3f6c636f27486b1565ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦……好像有什么活动呢。\r\n是哪一个班的班长负责的呢？\r\n……这得好好调查才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e185aaab63eb308f5c721bd3d5dec421201ab8d1ab08ce0253145499e0790b83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f0a79688bca08a78d7b445",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像很热闹诶……没有班长的允许\r\n竟然擅自这么开心……\r\n唔～也让我一起加入啦ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c610c2c6381416789ecc12062024f6a3837bc1fa709382fcb9388af137eef3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9836c04483e6c71fd765c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认输了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d882e67850950b4582a04bddec133c3ae9af1041e1911f9e1f82ff27e1b9e31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd4d5a9716b3ba2923a8525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了不起！训练员，\r\n名鉴的等级提升了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79353e8937ea105e86dbeed48cf9b1a45e379bd91b0de1d1650dee2e1391cdd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363ea25e75a2e9629fc18087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首先要清爽！\r\n再来就是一丝不苟！\r\n这就是模范便服该有的要素！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70152eb86594269128187720c646451c7209557f3b4e8890be36c70c819e4c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a72357799ed27e35b6d13f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迅速穿上去就会觉得暖和，\r\n迅速脱下来就会觉得凉爽！\r\n很聪明？对吧对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a99bde4c62ef30c3e2a08a6f172270865f973e80c4afcb32d8141c5915466fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c386ca0d1a96851bdb4998e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦同学的便服也很好看！\r\n哪天试着穿与她「同款的穿搭」，\r\n似乎也不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82e1be17a2e4f73a0d48f041db27a97564b4121c94dd4a687abbe5d82479ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7400273ebeee7bc8204e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我一定要赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e11f26b3cf17f8c120f7fdbd3839750c50492fac2bfaa213e9236ddee1d08e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2021f0c5fe34622a304a91f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是当ーーー然的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7422e91816ed3180f21b264503c7624c8b7a235f5b6240faba6474f156b3dc15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1346f1c5364158051436d03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认输了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d882e67850950b4582a04bddec133c3ae9af1041e1911f9e1f82ff27e1b9e31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3144691111a656790ec34c65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我一定要赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e11f26b3cf17f8c120f7fdbd3839750c50492fac2bfaa213e9236ddee1d08e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57079ae05315b7855610d815",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新纪录！我正在成长的巅峰期！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90bbb13924acd7eda0c981ee44cdc69050d5c20a8c59a6ef8066b4f3bcab8131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb955f809a2b651ae8dbbf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我堂堂正正地爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "692b594bc1a288ecdefaa6c8d60df643f9e2bafc2ae0af23092ef052baf6cfe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cea67a0a8e0f0d89ee55dcfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背要挺直！抬头挺胸地过去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4f64dbc07ce655511d9db197b2555d04272f9cdc530a79a1175f5e033e45eaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbbf65be80fe469949c2dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的身体在熊熊燃烧呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e75613c5d8ce9d2f6c7023fafd2438e96123ad85adb678232a071ec9d1bcb2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d831664fff125c7f94c4b531",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2865827b1e264a56f30c3f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧来吧！\r\n请尽情锻炼我这个难得的人才吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a799df59fd60cefb626b840f64c24a1643a01a75f9d63a1c314c2908c155b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fd897b8ce01b4d9e5c9b82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人生就是反复地预习加复习！\r\n这是成为优等生的第一步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60579a6271db35b758c333c350a5d3f59cdae761b561c6f504b68857eedf64ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5516c10814becb984eb4bdeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在比赛中爆进了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "689ec874223e806a89feeab3b65a2ac565ba2e995722a7c30dac1f06305b3888",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d0598d123acb55fd5614f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ァーつッ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a47e23c6a3dcb49da79f9d16aa01184248d3bc9817e51d110963d8e8abcd2300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c42b1947cff2ba8a9faa0245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0925762b756027540ca692c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！感觉充满了力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4aab2b9914e844eb1559f5f3c9de5af448802390187ecbdd007d4805ddbbc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4b15fc76492ed2c651545a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学級委員長！",
      "source_fingerprint": "159d2abf4953da0d24431fdea4fc0da2ae60734fe700c887849adc67d4e10eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b25ac4c9f55cdcae0ee597b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バックシーン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5d4e59c4575679be279992c581148ee85a894e939269604cc79d9c2bc8a7e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "1207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a28409ce6a7d1bed6a79171",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ebd00727eb9ab7c6cc473b7d6e7bb4fddd26ccf4d16b1f362bf14f3ac59e047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b3912fe8bef32c21f46897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有班长在您身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed31bdc94371aef9e9ed870767c7718f30a178455460f9d42f9f3249881bd955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd49bb23eed88ffc149cf79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:facab2b1cbf948f3d6e7861f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊唔！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd7f6ca43fad1849d84b23d1bec8dc0aefdd276a4dd68b74493586c71e318ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5283df159ad8ca0218f2a4e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很值得嘉奖呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da7b630f97ee60e52cd19939bd14421b6a0ce84384e30ee94500e5129246863",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
